<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.relay.fm/focused/269">On this episode of <em>Focused</em></a>, Mike and I talk about how the spaces around us shape our focus. We start with physical rooms and work our way through digital clutter, notifications and the people we share a workspace with.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We also get into sound and rituals, the design of Disney&#8217;s Burbank studio, and the point where redesigning a space turns into one more distraction. Then we share what we&#8217;re reading and pick new focus challenges.</p>



